# DO NOT APPLY UNTIL STEP 6 OF THE RUNBOOK (follower migration).
#
# Today kongaloosh.com redirects the fediverse discovery paths to Bridgy Fed
# (kongaloosh-app.conf, the line:
#     rewrite ^/\.well-known/(host-meta|webfinger).* https://fed.brid.gy$request_uri? redirect;
# ). Replace that line, inside the kongaloosh.com 443 server block, with:

    location ~ ^/\.well-known/(webfinger|host-meta|nodeinfo)$ {
        proxy_pass http://127.0.0.1:8080;
        proxy_set_header Host social.kongaloosh.com;
        proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-For $proxy_add_x_forwarded_for;
        proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-Proto https;
    }

# After this, `acct:alex@kongaloosh.com` resolves to the GoToSocial account
# and the Bridgy Fed bridged site is no longer discoverable by WebFinger
# (its actor URL https://fed.brid.gy/kongaloosh.com keeps working, which is
# what the Move activity needs).
